Location: Data represent Swiss conditions
Technology: no technologies are specified
Time period: Data represents conditions of the early 1990ties
Production volume: na
Sampling: data based on expert estimate and further assumption to determine the material consumption. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9fb270a3-c3ac-3baa-9a25-bb788e166390.xml</text>
